{
  "_comment": [
    "Identity is keyed on CHARACTER ID (chNN on every unit line of fe7_state, hex, uppercase; the",
    "key here is NN without the ch prefix). ENEMIES and GREEN lines carry it too since 2026-09-29.",
    "It is (charPtr - 0x08BDCE18) / 0x34, verified against the ROM's own ID byte on 2026-09-27,",
    "and it survives both promotion (which changes clsNN) and death-compaction (which changes rNN).",
    "",
    "Several characters have TWO ids: one for Lyn's tale and one for the main game (Lyn is 03 and",
    "2D, Kent 17 and 2F, ...). Both are listed. Bosses, generics and morphs are left out on",
    "purpose: only playable characters are listed, so an ENEMIES or GREEN line whose chNN IS in",
    "this table is a named character who can probably be recruited (Heath is ch20 as an enemy,",
    "Guy ch06), and one whose chNN is missing is a boss or a generic.",
    "",
    "byClass is the pre-chNN scheme and is only consulted when a line has no chNN, i.e. logs",
    "written before 2026-09-27. bySlot overrides a specific array slot and beats byClass.",
    "",
    "Portrait files go in public/portraits/, lowercase (kent.png). A missing file falls back to a",
    "placeholder tile, so they can be added one at a time."
  ],
